  <Translations>
    <Translation Language="en-US">On top of that, {monto} is HELD as a deposit. It isn't a charge: it's released when you return the equipment.</Translation>
    <Translation Language="es-CO">Además se RETIENEN {monto} de garantía. No es un cobro: se libera al devolver el equipo.</Translation>
